      "answer": "SELECT a.id, b.id, MIN(a.end, b.end) - MAX(a.start, b.start)\nFROM bookings AS a\nJOIN bookings AS b ON a.room = b.room AND a.id < b.id\nWHERE a.start < a.end AND b.start < b.end\n  AND MAX(a.start, b.start) < MIN(a.end, b.end)\nORDER BY a.id, b.id;\n",
